 <div class="container chart-card"><div class="chart-card-header"><div><span class="chart-overline">EXPLORATION 01 · HISTORICAL OUTCOMES</span><h3>Comeback probability by game state</h3></div><span class="chart-pill">D3 · HEATMAP</span></div>{#if fingerprints.length}<ComebackHeatmap data={fingerprints}/>{:else}<div class="skeleton">Loading fourth-quarter game states…</div>{/if}<div class="chart-note"><span>READING THIS CHART</span><p>Values represent the share of distinct trailing team-games in each time/deficit cell that ultimately won. A team-game is counted once within a cell; the same game may appear in multiple cells.</p></div></div></section>
 <section class="chapter"><div class="container"><div class="chapter-heading"><div class="section-index">03 / THE RESPONSE</div><div class="chapter-row"><div><p class="kicker">INSIGHT TWO · CHANGING SHOT SELECTION</p><h2>Under pressure, the three-pointer becomes a lever.</h2></div><p>As teams fall further behind and the clock winds down, shot selection can change. Compare the percentage of all field-goal attempts that come from beyond the arc across four time windows.</p></div></div>
 <div class="container chart-card"><div class="chart-card-header"><div><span class="chart-overline">J1 · THREE-POINT ATTEMPTS</span><h3>Three-point reliance versus deficit</h3></div><span class="chart-pill">D3 · MULTISERIES LINE</span></div>{#if three.length}<ThreePointChart data={three}/>{:else}<div class="skeleton">Loading shot-selection metrics…</div>{/if}<div class="chart-note"><span>READING THIS CHART</span><p>Numerator: trailing-team three-point attempts. Denominator: all trailing-team field-goal attempts in the same state. The score margin is measured <em>before</em> each shot.</p></div></div></section>
 <section id="fingerprints" class="chapter section-tinted"><div class="container"><div class="chapter-heading"><div class="section-index">04 / THE TACTICS</div><div class="chapter-row"><div><p class="kicker">INNOVATIVE VIEW · J4-R</p><h2>Every game state has its own tactical fingerprint.</h2></div><p>One number cannot tell the whole story. A custom multivariate glyph combines three-point reliance, shot frequency, and turnover frequency—while an outer arc shows the associated historical comeback rate.</p></div></div>
 <div class="container chart-card fingerprint-card"><div class="chart-card-header"><div><span class="chart-overline">J4-R · ORIGINAL MULTIVARIATE GLYPH DESIGN</span><h3>The Tactical Fingerprint Map</h3></div><span class="chart-pill novel">NOVEL DESIGN · D3 SVG</span></div>{#if fingerprints.length}<FingerprintMap data={fingerprints}/>{:else}<div class="skeleton">Loading tactical fingerprints…</div>{/if}<div class="chart-note"><span>DESIGN NOTE</span><p>The three spokes use <em>separate normalizations</em> and should not be compared as raw units. The arc represents the historical outcome, not a model prediction. Select any cell to inspect actual units and sample sizes.</p></div></div></section>
