 <section class="closing"><div class="container closing-grid"><div><p class="kicker">THE MAIN MESSAGE</p><h2>More urgency does not automatically mean more momentum.</h2></div><div><p>Late-game aggression can look promising on the surface. But smarter interpretation means looking at offensive behavior alongside the score deficit, the clock, and the outcomes of comparable historical games.</p><p class="conclusion-note">This is a prototype of a descriptive data story, not a betting recommendation or causal model. Replace illustrative preview data with the provided real-data pipeline before drawing conclusions.</p></div></div></section>
